OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies and two others injured in
OL,4,Alate-night crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and two other men were
OL,7,Finjured in a crash on the A26, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fcollision involving a silver Volkswagen
OL,12,FPolo and a black Renault Megane at
OL,13,FMalling Down, near Lewes, at about
OL,14,F22:00 GMT on Saturday.
OL,16,FSussex Police said a 46-year-old man
OL,17,Ffrom Worthing, who was a passenger in
OL,18,Fthe Polo, died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
