OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies and two others injured in
OL,4,Alate-night crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Polo, a 37-year-old
OL,7,Fman from Worthing, and the Megane's
OL,8,Fdriver, a 23-year-old man from
OL,9,FCrowborough, were both taken to
OL,10,Fhospital with injuries, said the force.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
